  "description": "Welcome to Frankfurt! Explore the rails of a sprawling modern metropolis, and take control of regional, commuter and inter-city express duties in Train Sim World®. Lean into the action with the all-new DB BR 411 ICE-T; tilting heavy metal optimised for smooth and faster travel. An extravaganza of electric traction awaits!\n\nAs a vital commuter, regional and international hub, the massive Frankfurt (Main) Hbf needs little introduction and is regarded as one of the most important stations in Germany. All traffic in all directions; take ICE and regional trains on a sharp curve out of the city Eastward and wind through the Kinzig Valley to the highspeed interchange at Fulda.\n\nTilting traction is twinned with an array of Deutsche Bahn’s finest. From the classic cab of the DB BR 114 to the modern screens of the DB BR 193 Vectron; embark on regional passenger and heavy freight in-between the ICE action."
